摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Provider manager for DeepSeek Harness (DSH): edit llm-pi-ai providers, API keys and models in Settings, test a model, discover an endpoint's models, 218 provider templates. · DSH 供应商工作室","id":"gh:1445567178","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-provider-studio","slug":"realchendahuang/dsh-provider-studio","topics":["api-key","cordis","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","llm","plugin","provider","settings"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Provider manager for DeepSeek Harness (DSH): edit llm-pi-ai providers, API keys and models in Settin"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"gs, test a model, discover an endpoint's models, 218 provider templates. · DSH 供应商工作室"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-provider-studio"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A provider manager for DeepSeek Harness. It replaces the built-in **Models** settings page and edits"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" the `llm-pi-ai` provider configuration directly: browse providers, reveal or replace API keys, mana"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ge models and their advanced parameters, test connectivity, and pull the model list from an endpoint"},{"id":"p4s4","text":" — without hand-editing `cordis.patch.yml`."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Why this plugin"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The built-in Models page only sees what the settings schema projects: fields the schema does not dec"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"lare are dropped on save, and an API key can be written but never read back. This plugin reads the r"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"aw `llm-pi-ai` patch document and edits it in place, so:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Keys are readable.** Masked by default; reveal, copy, replace or clear one in place. The authori"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"tative copy never leaves DSH's credentials service.\n- **Advanced parameters survive.** Per-model `re"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"asoningEfforts` and `compat`, per-provider `headers`, transport and retry settings, image budgets — "},{"id":"p7s4","text":"all editable, none silently lost on save.\n- **Everything per provider on one page.** Display name, p"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"rotocol, Base URL, key, models, connectivity tests and batch model discovery.\n- **Probes match real "},{"id":"p7s6","text":"requests.** Test and Discover call the same path with the same custom headers DSH uses, so a probe t"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"hat passes here passes in a session.\n- **218 provider templates.** Prefilled from models.dev, 201 wi"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"th a shipped brand logo; the rest fall back to initials.\n- **Config you can take with you.** Export "},{"id":"p7s9","text":"a single provider as paste-ready YAML — credential names only, never key material.\n- **Reversible.**"},{"id":"p7s10","text":" One line in the bundle patch hides the official Models page; flip it back or uninstall and it retur"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"e line in the bundle patch hides the official Models page; flip it back or uninstall and it returns."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Requires DSH 0.2.2-rc.1 or later on a `desktop` or `web` profile."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Or from the desktop GUI: **Plugins → Add plugin**, paste\n`github:realchendahuang/dsh-provider-studio"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"#v1.3.1`, install, then quit and restart DSH."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Settings → **Providers** appears (the plugin list calls it *Provider Studio*), and the official Mode"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ls page is replaced."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Documentation"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Document | What it covers |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Installation | GUI and CLI install, profiles, updating, uninstalling, version compatibility |\n| Us"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"age | Every screen, parameter and shortcut, with screenshots |\n| Design | Why the official page is r"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"eplaced, how it works, known limitations |\n| FAQ | Blank settings page, 404 probes, empty keys, peer"},{"id":"p15s4","text":" dependency warnings |\n| Development | Build, gate, tests, release flow, icon pipeline |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Chinese: 安装 · 使用 · 设计 · 常见问题 · 开发"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"|:---:|:---:|"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The provider list |\nModel editing, with per-model advanced parameters |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The usage guide has the rest."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Contributing"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Issues and pull requests are welcome. Run `npm run check` and `npm test` before opening a PR; see de"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" pull requests are welcome. Run `npm run check` and `npm test` before opening a PR; see development."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"MIT © 2026 dsh-provider-studio contributors. Third-party assets and trademarks are listed in THIRD_P"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"rovider-studio contributors. Third-party assets and trademarks are listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
